{"steam_appid":3263320,"steam_name":"Carry The Glass","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3263320/1917654076/4762a5a347d6e3050c26cdd710e668767cb4deac/1754432758/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1755276473","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257178789/b96b1265725bc24a9354ed903a67888b888a3728/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755276473","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263320/ss_463d115ced38c71a2e2f1e5eca2a0099ee78ccd3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784719075","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263320/6f1f47b133671d2e294b8044b00a564a2e6488f7/ss_6f1f47b133671d2e294b8044b00a564a2e6488f7.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784719075","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263320/3de064b51f84d8eaf7a0ab8e6a4f3e091f9ddd7f/ss_3de064b51f84d8eaf7a0ab8e6a4f3e091f9ddd7f.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784719075","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263320/4812b64f4ff38f92d8719e471064c7a55edaf6ba/ss_4812b64f4ff38f92d8719e471064c7a55edaf6ba.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784719075","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263320/2f8aa7e7606c02a88524151029c1b0a9395872bc/ss_2f8aa7e7606c02a88524151029c1b0a9395872bc.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784719075"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bring the glass to the customer!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As two construction workers, you are transporting a glass window for a tall structure. On this journey you have to be careful with the glass because it is very fragile. Can you make it to the top without breaking it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263320/extras/437cf12a3def76670a6f953f749ef3ee.poster.avif?t=1784719075\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263320/extras/437cf12a3def76670a6f953f749ef3ee.webm?t=1784719075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263320/extras/437cf12a3def76670a6f953f749ef3ee.mp4?t=1784719075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer: Get help from a friend to carry the glass!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite a trusted friend to your lobby to carry the glass with you!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263320/extras/3c2e1e12d1c9e2d3512db830f70d6be6.poster.avif?t=1784719075\" width=644 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263320/extras/3c2e1e12d1c9e2d3512db830f70d6be6.webm?t=1784719075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263320/extras/3c2e1e12d1c9e2d3512db830f70d6be6.mp4?t=1784719075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters with physics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We've added physics to every part of the characters to improve the gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263320/extras/4051855d294fa5f781f39411ce2e189c.poster.avif?t=1784719075\" width=592 height=514 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263320/extras/4051855d294fa5f781f39411ce2e189c.webm?t=1784719075\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263320/extras/4051855d294fa5f781f39411ce2e189c.mp4?t=1784719075\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skyscraper &amp; Lighthouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263320/extras/7a30ab97afe5e35ab5ff96c176b2d795.avif?t=1784719075\" width=899 height=404 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes: Normal, Hard (less checkpoints), Impossible (no checkpoints)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you want a more casual experience, you should try Normal mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if you believe you can make it to the top without breaking the glass, then hard mode or the impossible mode might be for you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263320/extras/63f862ef75ff5c867170d730e7acb30f.avif?t=1784719075\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3263320/extras_big/63f862ef75ff5c867170d730e7acb30f.avif?t=1784719075 width=800 height=274 /></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8/10/11 (64-Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3-4170 @ 3.7Ghz OR Intel i5 750 @ 2.67Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia 650TI OR AMD R7 250x<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 650 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 8/10/11 (64-Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 750 @ 2.67Ghz or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVidia GTX 970 OR NVidia GTX 1060 3GB OR AMD R9 290x OR AMD RX 470<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 650 MB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Casual","Indie","Simulation"],"developers":["Çağatay Demir","Enes Kaplan"],"publishers":["SlugShot Games"],"release_date":"23 Oct, 2024"}